WEBVTT

00:00:00.599 --> 00:00:01.470
Hello everyone.

00:00:01.702 --> 00:00:04.270
In this lesson, we wax step by step:

00:00:04.617 --> 00:00:09.790
lower legs with soft wax, underarms with hard wax, and tidying the brows.

00:00:10.219 --> 00:00:12.350
Temperature, timing and products:

00:00:12.615 --> 00:00:16.590
always follow the wax brand's instructions, and your salon's procedure.

00:00:17.255 --> 00:00:18.036
Step one:

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:18.996
preparation.

00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:22.756
Switch on the wax heater first, so the wax melts evenly.

00:00:23.065 --> 00:00:26.276
Wipe and disinfect the bed, and lay fresh bed paper.

00:00:26.603 --> 00:00:27.236
Set out:

00:00:27.506 --> 00:00:33.995
clean wooden spatulas in a jar, wax strips, gloves, skin cleanser, wax remover oil,

00:00:33.945 --> 00:00:35.236
soothing lotion,

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:37.156
tweezers, and small scissors.

00:00:37.585 --> 00:00:39.876
And a bin with a lid, for used spatulas.

00:00:40.467 --> 00:00:41.239
Step two:

00:00:41.456 --> 00:00:42.518
the consultation.

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:47.078
Look at the consultation form, and ask again, even with regular clients:

00:00:47.508 --> 00:00:51.053
are they taking acne medicine, using retinoid creams,

00:00:51.003 --> 00:00:53.558
or have they had a recent peel, laser,

00:00:53.663 --> 00:00:54.678
or sun exposure?

00:00:55.096 --> 00:00:57.959
Any allergies, and how did the last wax go?

00:00:58.504 --> 00:01:00.118
Look at the skin to be waxed:

00:01:00.216 --> 00:01:03.798
broken skin, sunburn, varicose veins:

00:01:03.989 --> 00:01:05.239
avoid those areas.

00:01:05.588 --> 00:01:07.239
Then tell the client beforehand:

00:01:07.575 --> 00:01:08.599
it will sting a little;

00:01:08.826 --> 00:01:10.918
if it feels uncomfortable, just tell me.

00:01:11.552 --> 00:01:12.356
Step three:

00:01:12.613 --> 00:01:16.996
the client changes in private, lies on the bed, and is covered with a large towel.

00:01:17.515 --> 00:01:21.076
Uncover only the area to be waxed, and tuck the towel neatly.

00:01:21.346 --> 00:01:24.436
Then wash your hands, dry them, and put on gloves.

00:01:25.044 --> 00:01:25.894
Step four:

00:01:26.233 --> 00:01:28.454
look at the hair, and cleanse the skin.

00:01:28.875 --> 00:01:32.694
On the lower leg, hair usually grows downward, toward the ankle.

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:34.854
If the hair is too long, trim it.

00:01:35.337 --> 00:01:40.134
Wipe the skin clean with a pre-wax cleanser, and wait until it is completely dry.

00:01:40.551 --> 00:01:44.824
With soft wax, many brands recommend a very thin layer of powder,

00:01:44.774 --> 00:01:46.774
so the wax sticks to the hair,

00:01:46.883 --> 00:01:47.734
not to the skin.

00:01:48.325 --> 00:01:49.175
Step five:

00:01:49.434 --> 00:01:50.455
the temperature test.

00:01:50.769 --> 00:01:55.095
Take a little wax with a new spatula, and test it on the inside of your own wrist.

00:01:55.438 --> 00:01:57.735
Warm and comfortable means it is ready.

00:01:58.230 --> 00:02:01.575
Then test a small spot on the client's skin, and ask her.

00:02:02.175 --> 00:02:03.025
Step six:

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:04.225
loading the wax.

00:02:04.622 --> 00:02:06.606
Dip the spatula, twist it gently,

00:02:06.556 --> 00:02:09.770
then scrape the underside against the edge of the pot,

00:02:09.720 --> 00:02:12.465
so there is only a thin layer on the top side,

00:02:12.497 --> 00:02:13.425
with no drips.

00:02:13.773 --> 00:02:14.385
Remember:

00:02:14.571 --> 00:02:18.785
once a spatula has touched the client's skin, it never goes back into the pot.

00:02:19.201 --> 00:02:21.585
Every time you take wax, a new spatula.

00:02:22.177 --> 00:02:23.043
Step seven:

00:02:23.224 --> 00:02:24.723
apply soft wax.

00:02:25.305 --> 00:02:27.043
Start at the top of the lower leg.

00:02:27.302 --> 00:02:31.189
Hold the spatula at a low angle, and apply a very thin layer,

00:02:31.139 --> 00:02:33.203
in the direction of hair growth:

00:02:33.465 --> 00:02:36.563
a strip as wide as the spatula, and about a hand's length.

00:02:37.072 --> 00:02:39.683
A thin, even layer pulls cleanly.

00:02:39.953 --> 00:02:44.563
Too thick, and the wax clumps, and the pull hurts without removing all the hair.

00:02:45.188 --> 00:02:45.929
Step eight:

00:02:46.322 --> 00:02:49.689
place the strip on the wax, leaving an edge at the end to hold.

00:02:50.211 --> 00:02:53.710
Rub firmly along the direction of hair growth, a few times,

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:55.289
so the strip grips the wax.

00:02:55.956 --> 00:02:56.885
Step nine:

00:02:57.069 --> 00:02:57.845
the pull.

00:02:58.316 --> 00:03:02.245
Your other hand rests right at the end of the strip, pulling the skin taut.

00:03:02.757 --> 00:03:07.376
Grip the edge of the strip, and pull very fast, against the direction of growth,

00:03:07.326 --> 00:03:08.405
close to the skin,

00:03:08.673 --> 00:03:10.165
almost parallel to the leg.

00:03:10.539 --> 00:03:11.765
Do not pull straight up.

00:03:12.034 --> 00:03:16.645
Many therapists ask the client to breathe in, then pull just as she breathes out:

00:03:16.912 --> 00:03:17.925
it feels easier.

00:03:18.175 --> 00:03:22.165
Right after, press your palm on the waxed area for a few seconds.

00:03:22.697 --> 00:03:27.452
Carry on strip by strip, close together, until the whole lower leg is done.

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:30.412
Never go over the same spot more than twice.

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:31.772
Stray hairs:

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:32.812
use tweezers.

00:03:33.241 --> 00:03:37.182
At the knee and the ankle, the skin folds and the bone sticks out,

00:03:37.132 --> 00:03:40.012
so use smaller strips, and hold the skin tauter.

00:03:40.515 --> 00:03:42.172
Forearms are done the same way:

00:03:42.521 --> 00:03:46.012
check the hair direction carefully first, because everyone is different.

00:03:46.616 --> 00:03:47.386
Step ten:

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:49.626
the underarms, with hard wax.

00:03:50.135 --> 00:03:54.346
The client lies on her back, with her arm raised and resting beside her head;

00:03:54.725 --> 00:03:56.186
the chest stays covered.

00:03:56.481 --> 00:03:58.346
The skin must be completely dry.

00:03:58.892 --> 00:04:02.046
Some brands recommend a very thin layer of oil first,

00:04:01.996 --> 00:04:04.506
so the hard wax doesn't stick to the skin:

00:04:04.777 --> 00:04:06.346
follow the brand's instructions.

00:04:06.776 --> 00:04:11.306
Underarm hair grows in several directions, so divide it into a few small areas.

00:04:11.905 --> 00:04:12.760
Step eleven:

00:04:13.074 --> 00:04:16.251
apply hard wax in the direction of growth for that area,

00:04:16.201 --> 00:04:19.879
a little thicker than soft wax, and leave a thick lip at the end,

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:20.760
to hold.

00:04:21.252 --> 00:04:22.600
Wait for the wax to set:

00:04:22.792 --> 00:04:24.920
no longer tacky, but still flexible.

00:04:25.336 --> 00:04:29.969
Hold the skin taut, grab the lip, and pull fast against the direction of growth,

00:04:29.919 --> 00:04:31.000
close to the skin.

00:04:31.463 --> 00:04:33.080
Press your hand on it right away.

00:04:33.346 --> 00:04:34.440
Then do the next area.

00:04:35.027 --> 00:04:35.885
Step twelve:

00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:36.925
the brows.

00:04:37.441 --> 00:04:41.085
Agree on the brow shape with the client first, and only then start.

00:04:41.594 --> 00:04:45.519
Take only a very small amount of hard wax, with a small spatula,

00:04:45.469 --> 00:04:48.365
and apply it to the stray hairs below the brow,

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:49.805
well away from the eye.

00:04:50.257 --> 00:04:51.885
The client closes her eyes.

00:04:52.144 --> 00:04:55.725
Hold the skin taut, pull fast, and press gently.

00:04:56.145 --> 00:04:57.645
Tidy the rest with tweezers.

00:04:58.310 --> 00:04:59.406
Step thirteen:

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:00.606
after waxing.

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:06.206
Remove any remaining wax with wax remover oil, gently, without rubbing hard.

00:05:06.465 --> 00:05:07.806
Apply soothing lotion.

00:05:08.132 --> 00:05:09.006
Tell the client:

00:05:09.195 --> 00:05:12.206
slight redness, and a few small bumps, are normal.

00:05:12.615 --> 00:05:17.815
For about the first day, avoid the sun, saunas, very hot baths or showers,

00:05:17.765 --> 00:05:19.486
and fragranced products,

00:05:19.596 --> 00:05:20.606
including deodorant.

00:05:20.941 --> 00:05:26.206
After a few days, exfoliate gently and moisturize, to help prevent ingrown hairs.

00:05:26.531 --> 00:05:30.526
If the skin is very red and stinging, or breaks out in a rash:

00:05:30.795 --> 00:05:34.846
apply a cool compress, and note the product, as in the incidents lesson.

00:05:35.477 --> 00:05:37.570
There are a few very common mistakes.

00:05:38.077 --> 00:05:42.290
Applying the wax really thick, thinking thicker grabs more hair:

00:05:42.556 --> 00:05:45.730
in fact, the pull hurts more, and is not clean.

00:05:46.319 --> 00:05:48.770
Pulling slowly, or pulling upward.

00:05:49.198 --> 00:05:50.930
Forgetting to hold the skin taut.

00:05:51.335 --> 00:05:56.130
Going over the same spot again and again, until the skin is bright red.

00:05:56.551 --> 00:05:58.530
And double dipping a used spatula.

00:05:58.783 --> 00:06:02.770
Avoid these mistakes, and the client will already see you as very professional.

00:06:03.424 --> 00:06:04.461
Step fourteen:

00:06:04.712 --> 00:06:08.221
write it in the internal notes on the client record in VaraaAi:

00:06:08.555 --> 00:06:12.541
the type of wax, the areas waxed, and how the skin reacted.

00:06:12.896 --> 00:06:13.741
Then clean up:

00:06:14.009 --> 00:06:17.581
spatulas, strips and gloves go into the bin with a lid.

00:06:17.928 --> 00:06:22.187
Wipe the outside of the wax pot, disinfect the bed, change the bed paper,

00:06:22.137 --> 00:06:23.341
and wash your hands.

00:06:23.695 --> 00:06:26.541
And now, please take the short quiz below the video.
